# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   See https://github.com/pyenv/pyenv/issues/530
#.python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if cloud platform or a clean env is used, clearing may be needed.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock is associated with poetry.lock and can be tracked.
#poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock is associated with pdm.lock and can be tracked.
#.pdm.toml
#.pdm-plugins/
#pdm.lock

# PEP 582; dependency directory created by pdm when keeping dependencies local
__pypackages__/

